---
// spec: S14 (/mock-series: kaise chalti hai, schedule, qeemat, order sirf naam+number), F02-AC1; intent 13 (Ad: Nahin), 7.3
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import ProductCard from '../components/ProductCard.astro';
import TrustStrip from '../components/TrustStrip.astro';
import OrderSteps from '../components/OrderSteps.astro';
import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';
import seo from '../data/seo.json';
import { getProduct } from '../lib/catalog';

const meta = seo.pages['/mock-series'];
const product = getProduct('mock-series');
const steps = [
  'Order karein: sirf naam aur WhatsApp number.',
  'JazzCash ya Easypaisa se payment WhatsApp par.',
  'Payment ke baad 2 ghante ke andar aap ko WhatsApp group mein shamil kiya jata hai aur pehla test bheja jata hai.',
  'Mahine bhar group mein mock tests aate hain; tests ka schedule group mein bataya jata hai.',
];
const faq = [
  { q: 'Muft mock tests aur series mein kya farq hai?', a: 'Muft mock tests portal par khud dein. Paid series WhatsApp group mein ek mahine ke liye chalti hai, tarteeb se.' },
  { q: 'Mahina khatam hone par?', a: 'Series ek mahine ki hai. Agle mahine ke liye dobara order karein.' },
  { q: 'Kya group mein mera number doosron ko dikhega?', a: 'WhatsApp group mein members ke number ek doosre ko nazar aate hain; yeh WhatsApp ka tareeqa hai. Agar yeh pasand nahin to order se pehle WhatsApp par baat kar lein.' },
];
---
<Base title={meta.title} description={meta.description}>
  <div class="container-page py-6">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Job ki tayyari', href: '/job-prep' }, { label: 'Mock test series' }]} />
    <h1 class="mt-3">Mock test series: mahana</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-muted max-w-[68ch]">Ek mahine ke mock tests WhatsApp group mein. Order ke liye sirf naam aur number.</p>

    <div class="mt-6 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px] lg:items-start">
      <div>
        <section aria-labelledby="how-heading">
          <h2 id="how-heading" class="mb-3">Kaise chalti hai</h2>
          <ol class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            {steps.map((s, i) => (
              <li class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="tabular inline-flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary text-sm font-bold" aria-hidden="true">{i + 1}</span>
                <span>{s}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ol>
        </section>

        <section class="my-8 max-w-[68ch]" aria-labelledby="why-heading">
          <h2 id="why-heading">Series kyun</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Akele tayyari mein sab se bara masla tarteeb ka hota hai: aaj parh liya, kal reh gaya. Mock test series ek mahine ke liye
            yeh tarteeb deti hai. Tests waqt par aate hain, aap waqt laga kar hal karte hain, aur har test ke baad pata chalta hai ke
            kahan kamzori hai.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Series WhatsApp group mein chalti hai, kyun ke wahi sab se asaan hai: alag app, password ya account ki zaroorat nahin. Is
            liye order mein koi tafseel nahin mangi jati, sirf naam aur WhatsApp number. Payment ke baad 2 ghante ke andar aap ko
            group mein shamil kar ke pehla test bhej diya jata hai, kaam ke auqaat (subah 9 se raat 10 baje) ke andar.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Tests ka schedule aur tareeqa group mein bataya jata hai. Har test ke baad apni ghaltiyan likh lein aur agle test se pehle
            unhi topics ko dohrayen. Isi se score barhta hai.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Series ke sath muft practice bhi jari rakhein: <a href="/daily-test">aaj ka test</a>, <a href="/mock-tests">muft mock tests</a>
            aur <a href="/notes">notes</a>. Apni post ke liye <a href="/past-papers">solved past papers</a> bhi faida dete hain.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      {product && (
        <aside aria-label="Order" class="lg:sticky lg:top-4">
          <ProductCard product={product} />
        </aside>
      )}
    </div>

    <TrustStrip />
    <OrderSteps />
    <FAQ items={faq} />
  </div>
</Base>
